OL,3,AGreens investigate party member behind
OL,4,AZionism motion
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Green Party has launched an
OL,7,Finvestigation into party member Lubna
OL,8,FSpeitan, after it emerged she was
OL,9,Flisted in court documents as a "close
OL,10,Ffriend" of a man later jailed for
OL,11,Fsupporting al-Qaeda.
OL,13,FSpeitan was behind a controversial
OL,14,FGreen Party conference motion which
OL,15,Fdescribed Zionism as a form of racism.
OL,17,FA Green Party spokesperson said: "Where
OL,18,Fmembers have expressed views that do
OL,19,Fnot fit in with the party's values, we
OL,20,Fhave internal processes to investigate
OL,21,Fand an investigation is underway."
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,0,100
