OL,3,AGreens investigate party member behind
OL,4,AZionism motion
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a post on Instagram, before the
OL,7,FGreen Party had confirmed its
OL,8,Finvestigation to the BBC, Speitan said:
OL,9,F"I reject all defamatory and nonsense
OL,10,Fclaims made about me."
